 `CustomerRepository` deliberately behaves like a real paged backend: it refuses
 to return more than `MAX_PAGE_SIZE` (200) rows in a single call. Callers page.

+## Filtering
+
+The view at `/` filters by name and by status, and the backend applies both.
+The filter is kept in the address bar so that a filtered list can be bookmarked
+or shared:
+
+```text
+/?name=vir&status=ACTIVE,CLOSED
+```
+
+- `name` is split on whitespace; every term must appear in the first or last
+  name. Case and accents are ignored.
+- `status` is a comma-separated list of `CustomerStatus` names.
+
+Empty filters leave no parameter behind.
+
